{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>懂車帝方面表示，除剎車踏板支架相關視頻外，懂車帝實測賬號近期未更新過其他內容，「7月後視頻都刪了」屬於謠言；還有圖片把懂車帝原創賬號在不同時間、不同系統版本，作品數量分別顯示的四捨五入後「1.5萬」和精確數字「14639」拼接起來，得出的「刪視頻」結論屬於謠言；還有將兩個不同賬號的發佈作品數據拼接，聲稱的「刪視頻」也屬於謠言。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/240/w550h2890/20261016/eb7f-b7bdff30fd8e84d70bf5835bf978ed02.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/240/w550h2890/20261016/eb7f-b7bdff30fd8e84d70bf5835bf978ed02.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:00:19.721455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:44:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:42.187932+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:57:41.845890+00:00","content_hash":"da6f5504051744bed17277cbca56c792208985dfb6e2a4479e3df44ea2fe1269","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}